{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0023","paragraphs":[{"id":"pa060e2008111-1","text":"梦入江南烟水路。"},{"id":"p93d5cddfa22e-1","text":"行尽江南，不与离人遇。"},{"id":"pccbb5faea516-1","text":"睡里消魂无说处。"},{"id":"p350b289bef5b-1","text":"觉来惆怅消魂误。"},{"id":"p219812680ac1-1","text":"欲尽此情书尺素。"},{"id":"p8821e749ecbc-1","text":"浮雁沈鱼，终了无凭据。"},{"id":"p62ca54e69fcc-1","text":"却倚缓弦歌别绪。"},{"id":"pf5d7c0809be5-1","text":"断肠移破秦筝柱。"}]}